      "message": "There are multiple paths where the ack isn\u0027t done in this method. Is that intentional?\n\nWhy not simply create an internal method `processMessageWithAck` as a wrapper and ack on finally?\n\nThere isn\u0027t really interest in managing the manual ack from this plugin, so it\u0027s more satisfying the new interface rather than applying any specific logic.\n\n\n\n```suggestion\n  protected  void processMessageWithAck(Event event, MessageAcknowledgement\u003cEvent\u003e acknowledgement) {\n    if (!brokerApi.get().isAutoAck()) {\n      acknowledgement.ack(event);\n    }\n\n    processMessage(event);\n  }\n  \n  protected void processMessage(\n      Event message, MessageAcknowledgement\u003cEvent\u003e messageAcknowledgement, boolean autoAck) {\n```",
